          "Use the same sample rule every week. A consistent sample shows whether a change helped. A different sample each week shows only that someone looked. This task brief and handover note step is logged for the Outsourcing Assistant team and reviewed by the client success manager at the next checkpoint.",
          "End the review with one process change, one owner, and one check date. If nothing changes, the review becomes another status meeting. For the Outsourcing Assistant desk, this task brief and handover note check is dated and routed to the client success manager before the next handoff.",
